  "instructions": [
    "preheat the oven to 400f (200c).",
    "line the tagliere with parchment paper.",
    "season the monkfish fillets with salt, black pepper, and garlic powder.",
    "dot the top of each fillet with unsalted butter.",
    "drizzle the olive oil over the fillets.",
    "sprinkle the smoked paprika evenly over the fillets.",
    "place the tagliere in the oven and roast for 12 minutes.",
    "remove the tagliere from the oven and top each fillet with a sprinkle of fresh parsley and a squeeze of lemon juice.",
    "return the tagliere to the oven and roast for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "remove the tagliere from the oven and let it rest for 5 minutes.",
    "serve the monkfish fillets hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired.",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!"
